# Methods generator

Build a draft microscopy methods paragraph from the facility inventory. Choose the microscope and the hardware you actually used, then add experiment-specific acquisition settings before publication. The draft is structured around the **QUAREP-LiMi minimal reporting recommendations** for light microscopy ([Better reporting is better science](https://rupress.org/jcb/article/225/3/e202601032/281525/Better-reporting-is-better-science-Community)).

!!! note "Check before publication"
    This tool uses the current facility record. It does not reconstruct historical configurations or recover acquisition settings that are absent from the inventory or image metadata.

